.nh
.TH "PB-WAIT" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-wait - Wait for a machine readiness condition


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb wait <machine> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Wait for a machine readiness condition

.PP
Wait for the selected device to satisfy a named readiness condition from --for. --timeout bounds the wait, and an expired wait reports a failure instead of treating mere connectivity as readiness.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--for\fP="transport"
	readiness condition: runtime, transport, or ssh

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for wait

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=5m0s
	maximum time to wait


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb(1)\fP
